The page-154 formula is not the same as saying “all branch denominators divide the gcd chain.” In fact, using it naïvely with the skeleton `M_i` gives contradictions to Moh’s own divisibility, so I’m treating that as a notation/index trap and looking for code or prior notes that compute `μ_i` explicitly.
