xmodel/as109-support-review-grok-20260824.md:99:The freeze file records only the two pre-enumerator inputs. The verify script and JSON report are post-freeze, as the gate states. The registered program is not a transition enumerator: it recomputes the two frozen hashes and checks the closed-form triangular family at the seven sample exponents `m=1,2,3,108,109,110,1000`. Arithmetic is exact `F_109` sparse polynomials. No CAS, no floating point, no AWS.
