+# DELTA-DENOM -- denominator increments in Moh's major-disc radii
+
+Lane: `DELTA-DENOM`.  Agent: GPT-5.5/Codex.  Date: 2026-09-02.
+
+## 0. Custody and Scope
+
+The six frozen inputs were hashed before use.  All matched the charge:
