+## 1. Verdict
+
+**THEOREM DELTA-DENOM-ACTUAL (PROVED-HERE/UNREVIEWED).**  In Moh Prop. 5.3 the
+new radius `delta_{r-1}` is the minimum of `ord_t(alpha-beta)` over roots
+`alpha,beta` of
